OL,3,AUK to invest #100m in 'world first' AI
OL,4,ABiosecurity Lab
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK says it will establish a
OL,7,Fnational AI Biosecurity Lab (AIBL) to
OL,8,Fhelp strengthen its defences against
OL,9,Femerging biological threats.
OL,11,FAs part of Wednesday's Budget, the
OL,12,Fgovernment will commit #100m to
OL,13,Festablishing the new, "world first"
OL,14,Finstitute with the support of leading
OL,15,FAI firms.
OL,17,FThe chancellor will also pledge
OL,18,Fmillions of pounds in spending across a
OL,19,Frange of initiatives aimed at shoring
OL,20,Fup the UK's ability to respond to
OL,21,Fevolving cyber, biological and
OL,22,FAI-enabled threats.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
